WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.480
Suburban life

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.600
So much is the same

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.400
Week after week

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:20.500
Who hasn't had the impulse to put their life on hold for a moment?

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.280
Just vanish completely.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:33.020
My wife's first call... would be to my office.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.920
No, he hasn't come in.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.800
No, he didn't say anything.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.900
The car's still there

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.160
The plot thickens!

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:46.820
(police siren)

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.660
How far am I willing to let this go?

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.200
"Ta-da!"

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.800
(glass breaking)

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:21.720
(banging)

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.660
(frightened noise)

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.480
I never left my family

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.200
I left myself

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:46.680
Unshackled

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:51.460
I'll become the Howard Wakefield I was meant to be

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:56.100
(music)

